  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The Google sign-in endpoint now runs on EasyReasy.Auth's shared ExternalSignInEndpoint, so the no-store header, the audit record, the access-token cookie, the progressive-delay reset and the 200 or 401 happen exactly as for every other provider package. The sign-in itself is unchanged. One behaviour change: when several services the endpoint needs are missing at startup, AddGoogleAuthEndpoint now names all of them in one InvalidOperationException instead of throwing on the first. Requires EasyReasy.Auth 5.14.0. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy/blob/auth-google-v1.3.0/EasyReasy.Auth.Google/README.md#endpoint-behavior",
